1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
Kolbe's reaction.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:09,583
Dry sodium phenoxide absorbs carbon dioxide at one hundred and twenty five degrees under four to seven atmospheres.

3
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:12,786
Carbon dioxide is a weak electrophile.

4
00:00:12,786 --> 00:00:17,096
It attacks the ortho position of the activated phenoxide ring.

